WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.916
Welcome to Communication Quest.

2
00:00:01.916 --> 00:00:02.949
Getting the job takes more

3
00:00:02.949 --> 00:00:04.690
than having the right skills.

4
00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:07.279
You also need to communicate those skills clearly.

5
00:00:07.279 --> 00:00:09.532
Spin the wheel and travel from résumé to

6
00:00:09.532 --> 00:00:11.807
interview to your first day on the job.

7
00:00:11.807 --> 00:00:14.512
Along the way, you'll make communication decisions,

8
00:00:14.512 --> 00:00:16.695
get coaching from Rosie, and build skills

9
00:00:16.695 --> 00:00:18.344
you can use in the real world.
